{'symbol': 'UHS', 'date': '2023-04-25 16:16:00', 'title': 'UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES 2023 FIRST QUARTER FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'CONSOLIDATED RESULTS OF OPERATIONS, AS REPORTED AND AS ADJUSTED\xa0 – THREE-MONTH PERIODS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023 AND 2022: KING OF PRUSSIA, PA. , APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: UHS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS REPORTED NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO UHS WAS $163.1 MILLION, OR $2.28 PER DILUTED SHARE, DURING THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023, AS COMPARED TO $153.9 MILLION, OR $2.02 PER DILUTED SHARE, DURING THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2022.'}